OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,6,Fintervals, but there is a risk of
OL,7,Fisolated showers first thing, these
OL,8,Fdying out during the morning. Breezy
OL,9,Fto start, but this soon easing, and
OL,10,Ffeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Cloud thickening overnight,
OL,14,Fperhaps with some rain reaching the
OL,15,Fnorthwest by dawn. Wind strengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
