OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBecoming wet during the
OL,6,Fmorning with occasionally heavy rain
OL,7,Fand strong winds. Rain and wind
OL,8,Fgradually easing later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, becoming mostly dry during
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,13,Funsettled during this period, with a
OL,14,Fmixture of rain or showers and drier
OL,15,Fintervals with sunny spells.
OL,16,FOccasionally windy. Perhaps warm at
OL,17,Ffirst, trending near normal on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
